config USB_XHCI_HCD
    tristate "xHCI USB host controller"
    default y
    help
      PCI xHCI root-port host for SuperSpeed Bulk-Only SCSI storage and
      USB2/1.x Bulk-Only storage and boot HID keyboard/mouse. M builds xhci.ko.
      Hub routing, streams, isochronous endpoints and UAS are unsupported.
